            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Cōnsōbrīnus meus in vīllā avī habitat. My cousin lives in grandfather's country house."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine; cōnsōbrīna is a female cousin. First the child of a mother's sister. English cousin comes from it through French."
            }
          ]
